# Code organization

## One file, one job

| Kind | Put in | Max rough size |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Route screen | `pages/*Page.tsx` | ~80 lines — compose only |
| Presentational UI | `features/<f>/ui/*.tsx` | split if >150 lines |
| Feature TanStack wiring | `features/<f>/model/*.ts` | `resolve` + hooks, light JSX ok for columns |
| Feature helpers | `features/<f>/lib/*.ts` | pure functions |
| Biz use-cases | `application/use-cases/*.ts` | no React |
| Ports (API contracts) | `application/ports/*.ts` | interfaces only |
| Domain types / Zod | `entities/*.ts` | no React |
| Shared UI primitives | `components/ui` (shadcn) + `shared/ui` | no feature imports |
| Shared helpers | `shared/lib` | no feature imports |
| Constants | `shared/constants` or `features/<f>/lib/constants.ts` | see constants rule |
| Adapters / DI | `infrastructure/adapters`, `infrastructure/di` | see `di.mdc` |

## Split when

- Component mixes **fetch + form + table + layout** → extract `model/` hook + child UI.
- Same magic string/number appears **2+ times** → constant.
- JSX has business `if` trees → move to `application/use-cases` or pure `lib/`.
- Cross-feature need → promote type to `entities/`, helper to `shared/`.

## Import direction (forbidden ↑)

```
pages → features → application/entities/shared
features/model → resolve(TOKENS) only (not adapters)
app → bootContainer + providers (composition root)
```

Never: `entities` / `application` → React/Zustand/Query/adapters.
Never: `shared` → `features`. Never: feature A → feature B deep import.
Never: DI via React Context.

## Naming

See **`file-naming.mdc`** — all filenames are **lowercase kebab-case**.

- Components: `request-workspace.tsx` (export `RequestWorkspace`)
- Pages: `workspace-page.tsx` (export `WorkspacePage`)
- Hooks: `use-send-request.ts`
- Pure libs: `method-colors.ts`
- Constants: `*.constants.ts` or `shared/constants/<domain>.ts`
- Zod schemas: `*.schema.ts` or colocated in `entities/schemas.ts` until split needed
